codex
The local catalog matches the claimed grants, function access, and Realtime exclusion. I found a possible completeness 
bug in the bulk mention read: it can request more rows than PostgREST’s 1,000-row limit. I’m checking the reachable 
page sizes, along with rollback fidelity and malformed UUID handling.

